/* 关系探索成长记录（Figma 667:6212）：三格摘要、四段栏目切换（吸顶）、变化曲线、最近时间线、底部三级操作。 */
.growth-page {
  padding-top: 16rpx;
  padding-bottom: calc(72rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
}

.growth-content {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-section);
}

/* 摘要：纸白卡里三个等宽数据格，宋体数字 + 一行说明 */
.growth-summary {
  display: flex;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  padding: 28rpx 16rpx;
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-card);
  background: var(--p3-surface);
}

.growth-summary-item {
  display: flex;
  flex: 1 0 0;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4rpx;
  min-width: 0;
  padding: 28rpx;
}

.growth-summary-value {
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-family: var(--p3-font-serif);
  font-size: 48rpx;
  line-height: 64rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 1rpx;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

.growth-summary-label {
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

/* 栏目切换：米纸胶囊四等分，滚动时吸顶 */
.section-nav {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 5;
  background: var(--p3-paper);
}

.section-nav__item {
  font-size: 32rpx;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.section-nav__item--active {
  font-weight: 500;
}

.growth-card {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
  padding: var(--p3-card);
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-card);
  background: var(--p3-surface);
}

.growth-card__titles {
  display: flex;
  flex: 1 0 0;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4rpx;
  min-width: 0;
}

.growth-card__head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.growth-link {
  width: auto;
  min-height: var(--safe-touch, 88rpx);
  margin: -24rpx 0;
  color: var(--p3-primary);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.growth-chips {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.growth-chart__title {
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

/* 折线图高 150：三条细线、2px 青瓷折线、空心点（绘制见 index.js paintChart） */
.growth-chart__canvas {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 300rpx;
}

.growth-chart__empty {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8rpx;
  padding: 32rpx;
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-group);
  background: var(--p3-paper);
}

.growth-chart__dates {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
  white-space: nowrap;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

.growth-trend {
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 30rpx;
  line-height: 52rpx;
}

.growth-timeline {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.growth-filter {
  width: 100%;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.growth-filter__row {
  display: inline-flex;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.growth-filter__row .p3-chip {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}

/* 阶段性反馈：研究者补充（青瓷浅底）与系统汇总（米纸）分开 */
.growth-source {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8rpx;
  padding: 28rpx 32rpx;
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-group);
  background: var(--p3-paper);
}

.growth-source--researcher {
  background: var(--p3-soft);
}

.growth-source--plain {
  padding: 0;
  background: transparent;
}

.growth-source__label {
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.growth-source__line {
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

.growth-narrative {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4rpx;
  padding-top: 16rpx;
  border-top: 2rpx solid var(--p3-hairline);
}

.growth-disclosure {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 0;
  text-align: left;
}

.growth-disclosure__chevron {
  display: flex;
  transition: transform 0.2s ease;
}

.growth-disclosure__chevron--open {
  transform: rotate(180deg);
}

.growth-form {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.growth-form__pair {
  display: flex;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.growth-form__pair .p3-field {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
}

/* 1–5 量尺：数值显示在轨道外，避免被滑块遮住 */
.slider-heading {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.value-badge {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  padding: 4rpx 20rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: var(--p3-soft);
  color: var(--p3-primary);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

.growth-slider {
  margin: 8rpx 12rpx;
}

.growth-actions {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}
